# Built binaries
/leonard
/leonard-mcp
/leonard-hook
/leonard-sync-github

# Per-project store and runtime state
.leonard/leonard.db
.leonard/leonard.db-journal
.leonard/leonard.db-wal
.leonard/leonard.db-shm
# Adapter runtime state. Written by the ground-truth adapter's post-edit
# hook and the self-logging adapter respectively; both are session-scoped
# machine state, not project content. Surfaced by Track B Phase 1, which
# enabled the ground-truth adapter here for the first time and left an
# untracked pending-audit.log behind on the first edit.
.leonard/pending-audit.log
.leonard/pending-decisions.log
# v0.52 (formerly v0.51): the [post_edit.verify].command trust
# fingerprint now lives OUTSIDE the project tree at
# $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/leonard/trust/<project-hash>.sha256, so no
# in-project gitignore is needed. The v0.51-era
# `.leonard/trusted-verifier.sha256` is no longer used; if you
# upgraded from v0.51, the old file is harmless but can be
# deleted.
# Orphan SQLite shadow files from concurrent leonard runs (Finder/
# tooling sometimes duplicates the DB and SQLite spawns parallel
# WAL/SHM per copy).
.leonard/leonard *.db
.leonard/leonard *.db-shm
.leonard/leonard *.db-wal

# Go
coverage.out
*.test
*.out

# Personal Claude Code config (per-user wiring, not project-shared)
.claude/settings.local.json

# macOS
.DS_Store
.bosun/

# Ephemeral session/process artifacts at repo root (briefs, scratch
# reports, launch-prep notes). The audits/ directory is the canonical
# home for retained audit history.
/phase-*-brief.md
/bughunt-*-brief.md
/fix-*-brief.md
/launch-readiness-*.md
/resume-here.md

# Local operator notes — not part of the public project.
/DOGFOOD.md
